---
// Agent = Model + Harness: the five harness responsibilities, which of them a minimal demo needs, and the environment outside.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 480"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d-mhs-title d-mhs-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d-mhs-title">Agent = Model + Harness</title>
	<desc id="d-mhs-desc">
		Inside the agent boundary, the Model decides and the Harness holds five stacked responsibilities: context
		management, tool interfaces, constrain, verify, and correct. A minimal demo needs only the first two; a production
		system needs all five. The Environment of databases, files, and users sits outside the agent, and the harness
		mediates the interaction with it in both directions.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d-mhs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="12" y="12" width="496" height="454" rx="14"></rect>
		<text x="28" y="44" class="dg-title">Agent</text>
		<text x="124" y="276" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">+</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="28" y="219" width="80" height="100" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="68" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Model</text>
		<text x="68" y="288" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">decides</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-container dg-harness">
		<rect x="140" y="56" width="354" height="390" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="156" y="86" font-weight="700">Harness</text>
		<g class="dg-edge">
			<path d="M352 104 H358 V434 H352 M358 269 H374"></path>
			<path d="M363 104 H368 V230 H363 M368 167 H374"></path>
		</g>
		<text x="380" y="173" class="dg-edge-label">minimal demo</text>
		<text x="380" y="275" class="dg-edge-label">production</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="156" y="104" width="192" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="139" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Context management</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="156" y="172" width="192" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="207" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Tool interfaces</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="156" y="240" width="192" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="264" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Constrain</text>
		<text x="252" y="286" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">what it may do</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="156" y="308" width="192" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="332" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Verify</text>
		<text x="252" y="354" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">did it work?</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="156" y="376" width="192" height="58" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="400" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Correct</text>
		<text x="252" y="422" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">recover or roll back</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-env">
		<rect x="592" y="209" width="120" height="120" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="652" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Environment</text>
		<text x="652" y="280" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">DBs · files</text>
		<text x="652" y="304" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">users</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="496" y1="269" x2="590" y2="269" marker-start="url(#d-mhs-arrow)" marker-end="url(#d-mhs-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="550" y="255" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-edge-label">mediates</text>
	</g>
</svg>
